      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is due to the fact that \"Is Animated\" is off by default on converted bones so the ferrets walk animations are being overwritten by the new system.\nEasily fixable by the avatar creator with a few clicks but it'd be nice if this was enabled by default for converted bones.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
