      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I want to add a possible solution to this: Any converted dynamic bone found on a humanoid bone should have “Is Animated” toggled on so tracking works as intended. This would fix most avatars that used dynamic bone for the funny wiggles like the ferrets.\nWould have edited the post but can’t as it has 5+ votes.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
