  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Any avatar that used dynamic bones on humanoid bones are just T/A pose. This affects almost all ferret avatars or really any avatar that used dynamic bones on humanoid bones.\nI understand conversion isn't to be relied on for all avatars, but there are years worth of ferret avatars that break due to this.",
